refentry.refsect1:
&reftitle.description;
public boolIo\Poll\Backend::isAvailable
Checks whether a Io\Poll\Context can be created with this backend on the current platform.

&reftitle.returnvalues;

 Returns &true; if the backend is available, &false; otherwise.
 Io\Poll\Backend::Auto is always available.

  &reftitle.examples;

   Selecting a backend only if it is available


<?php
use Io\Poll\Backend;
use Io\Poll\Context;

$backend = Backend::Kqueue->isAvailable() ? Backend::Kqueue : Backend::Auto;
$context = new Context($backend);

var_dump(Backend::Auto->isAvailable());


   &example.outputs;


bool(true)
